# Bot1's own Bolt is refused (CR 109.5) while one Shock is returned to Bot2's hand (not countered). Bot2's casts did not
# trigger the Horror (only your casts do). Bot1 takes 2 from the other Shock, Bot2 takes 3 from the Bolt.

